  "solution": "Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math> do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>. <br><div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>K</mi></semantics></math> là hình chiếu của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> lên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math> là hình chiếu của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> lên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Do tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đều cạnh bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>a</mi></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> thuộc đoạn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. <br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>H</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. <br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> nên<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>H</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>H</mi><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>H</mi><msup><mi>K</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>7</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>21</mn></msqrt><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>65</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/b92da4f90d36272a2ef2fd7baa752dc68bf32f88cca96ebb97b90e1fe867afe6.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
